@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S05-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: IdentityController" as ctl
participant "svc: AuditApplicationService" as svc
participant "repo: AuditRepository" as repo
participant "fact: AuditFact" as fact
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. audit(bearer, key, input)
activate ctl
note over ctl
authenticated actor + service key + audit:write; no client-supplied actor
end note
ctl -> svc: 2. external(actor, system, roles, requestId, type, objectType, objectId, target, before, after)
activate svc
note over svc,fact
whitelist → canonical JSON → payload hash;
AuditFact compact constructor truncates at to MILLIS.
POST time, persisted TIMESTAMP(3), replay and [at,at] query agree.
end note
group REQUIRES_NEW first attempt
svc -> repo: 3. find(requestId)
activate repo
deactivate repo
alt existing requestId
svc -> fact: 4. requireReplay(proposed)
activate fact
deactivate fact
note over svc
same content → old id; different content → 400 conflict
end note
else new requestId
svc -> repo: 5. append(fact)
activate repo
deactivate repo
end
end
alt concurrent unique-key violation
note over svc
failed insert transaction rolled back BEFORE catch re-read
end note
group separate REQUIRES_NEW
svc -> repo: 6. find(requestId)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> fact: 7. requireReplay(proposed)
activate fact
deactivate fact
note over svc
missing existing → rethrow DB exception; existing content rechecked
end note
end
else committed first attempt
note over svc
canonical record is durable
end note
end
note over svc,ctl
201 only after commit. Timeout retry uses original requestId; SQL failure is not 201.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml